cff-version: 1.2.0
title: Tables of generalized Hamming weights of projective Reed-Muller codes
message: >-
  If you use these tables, please cite them as below, together with the papers
  where the main bounds are proved: R. San-José, A recursive construction for
  projective Reed-Muller codes, IEEE Trans. Inform. Theory 70(12) (2024),
  8511-8523; and R. San-José, Common zeros of homogeneous polynomials and the
  weight hierarchy of projective Reed-Muller codes, arXiv:2611.08203 (2026).
type: dataset
authors:
  - given-names: Rodrigo
    family-names: San-José
    affiliation: Virginia Tech
    orcid: 'https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0944-7584'
abstract: >-
  Bounds and exact values for the generalized Hamming weights of projective
  Reed-Muller codes, with a justification for every value.
keywords:
  - generalized Hamming weights
  - weight hierarchy
  - projective Reed-Muller codes
  - coding theory
repository-code: 'https://github.com/RodrigoSanJose/ghw-tables'
url: 'https://rodrigosanjose.github.io/ghw-tables/'
# The Zenodo DOI that covers all versions, and always points to the latest one.
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.24020768
